<item><title>FG suspends Lagos-Ibadan bridge work after 20-hour gridlock</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/fg-suspends-lagos-ibadan-bridge-work-after-20-hour-gridlock-4bf1ce/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/fg-suspends-lagos-ibadan-bridge-work-after-20-hour-gridlock-4bf1ce/</guid><category>Nigeria</category><description>The federal government halted the work following a traffic jam on the expressway that lasted 20 hours.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 06:37:05 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ng.jpg" length="32450" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ng.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tinubu asks parliament to replace attempted-suicide jail terms with care</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/tinubu-asks-parliament-to-replace-attempted-suicide-jail-a79307/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/tinubu-asks-parliament-to-replace-attempted-suicide-jail-a79307/</guid><category>Nigeria</category><description>The proposal would offer medical support instead of prosecution, while a separate Senate bill on the issue has passed its second reading.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 06:32:17 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/tinubu-asks-parliament-to-replace-attempted-suicide-jail-a79307/share.jpg" length="41167" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/tinubu-asks-parliament-to-replace-attempted-suicide-jail-a79307/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
